Months added to the 28.5-month plan (P10 / P50 / P90), 8 h + 1 phone hour
  product ~15 h/month (the 10-15% slot)    +0.8 / +1.2 / +1.7 months  -> everything at P50 ~29.7
  product ~25 h/month                      +2.0 / +2.6 / +3.4 months  -> everything at P50 ~31.1
  product ~40 h/month                      +3.9 / +4.9 / +6.2 months  -> everything at P50 ~33.4
